{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51006","headline":"水名 · 宇文正","name":"水名","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江湖思旧好，河洛赏遗风。\n共托金门暇，来游白□□。\n竹霞开樽绿，桃花落□红。\n故乡渺天涯。\n应在□地□。\n（见影印本《新编纂图增类羣书类要事林广记》卷之七。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宇文正","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51006.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51006","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}